[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12614.309, "timestamp": "03:30:14", "text": "我们有一座城市要烧毁。 这是我理想的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12617.429, "timestamp": "03:30:17", "text": "政治立场。 是的。 醒醒吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12620.79, "timestamp": "03:30:20", "text": "武士。 你有一座城市要烧毁。   那是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12627.429, "timestamp": "03:30:27", "text": "这是……那个宝可梦，不是宝可梦。 呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12629.91, "timestamp": "03:30:29", "text": "我得把他弄到手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12632.55, "timestamp": "03:30:32", "text": "我刚刚激活了一个支线任务。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12634.87, "timestamp": "03:30:34", "text": "太棒了。   这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12637.269, "timestamp": "03:30:37", "text": "是为什么？ 还有，我这就给你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12643.19, "timestamp": "03:30:43", "text": "好的，我明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12645.349, "timestamp": "03:30:45", "text": "谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12646.95, "timestamp": "03:30:46", "text": "Shift"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12651.349, "timestamp": "03:30:51", "text": "赛博朋克 2077 参考资料。 是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12656.07, "timestamp": "03:30:56", "text": "我也很怀念玩《赛博朋克2077》的日子。 说实话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12658.95, "timestamp": "03:30:58", "text": "我感觉很舒服。"}]